lien<\/strong>, joueur de padel 3x\/semaine"}},"template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Collant mais pas trop, vraiment bien","text":"<p>Ce surgrip offre un contrôle parfait. Comme il ne glisse pas d'un millimètre, je gagne en précision sur mes volées et mes smashes. Le côté collant dure sur plusieurs sessions, contrairement à d'autres qui perdent leur effet après une heure.<\/p>","author":"<strong>Claire<\/strong>, classée 15\/2 au tennis"}},"template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-3":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Bien","text":"<p>Quand il fait froid et que mes mains sont sèches, c'est le seul surgrip que j'utilise. Il offre cette petite adhérence 'tacky' très rassurante. Il est fin mais accroche super bien.<\/p>","author":"<strong>Renan<\/strong>"}}},"block_order":["template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-1","template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-2","template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-3"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"Avis clients","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h1","text":"","color_scheme":"background-1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"square","column_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"inactive_stars_style":"solid","star_color":"#ffcc00","bg_star_color":"#ececec","show_quotes":true,"quotes_color_scheme":"accent-2","cards_color_scheme":"bg-overlay","type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":false,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":false,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","slider_mobile":true,"e